expired FETCH_ERROR_TLS CERT_HAS_EXPIRED the certificate of localhost has expired
future FETCH_ERROR_TLS CERT_NOT_YET_VALID the certificate of localhost is not valid yet
wrongname FETCH_ERROR_TLS ERR_TLS_CERT_ALTNAME_INVALID the certificate is not for localhost
self FETCH_ERROR_TLS DEPTH_ZERO_SELF_SIGNED_CERT the certificate of localhost is self-signed, so it is not trusted; if its root CA is installed on this machine, run with NODE_USE_SYSTEM_CA=1
other FETCH_ERROR_TLS UNABLE_TO_VERIFY_LEAF_SIGNATURE the certificate of localhost is signed by an authority that is not known; if its root CA is installed on this machine, run with NODE_USE_SYSTEM_CA=1
chain FETCH_ERROR_TLS UNABLE_TO_GET_ISSUER_CERT_LOCALLY the certificate of localhost is signed by an authority that is not known
rooted FETCH_ERROR_TLS SELF_SIGNED_CERT_IN_CHAIN the certificates of localhost lead to a root CA that is not trusted
localhost 200 ok
